  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multiprofile RNA with scvi_n200 and avgpool is the strongest completed setting (0.650 acc, 0.628 F1), and scvi_n200 also outperforms pca_n2000 in both single- and multiprofile RNA-only models. The key uncertainty is whether transformer aggregation can improve over avgpool for the best RNA encoder. config_006 tests this by changing only aggregation from avgpool to transformer while keeping rna_only, multiprofile, and scvi_n200 fixed, making it a clean comparison and a high-value use of the next experiment."
}

